WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.863
It's two in the morning.

2
00:00:02.863 --> 00:00:04.998
A discharge notice is in your hand.

3
00:00:04.998 --> 00:00:07.071
A denial letter sits on the table.

4
00:00:07.671 --> 00:00:11.160
And the system that's supposed to protect the person you love…

5
00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.632
has gone completely silent.

6
00:00:13.732 --> 00:00:16.202
For 800,000 Americans with kidney failure,

7
00:00:16.202 --> 00:00:19.084
and their care partners, that silence isn't rare.

8
00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:19.848
It's routine.

9
00:00:20.548 --> 00:00:22.110
So we built something to break it.

10
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.656
This is the Command Center. Every tool.

11
00:00:25.656 --> 00:00:26.867
Every federal contact.

12
00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:28.793
Every complaint pathway. One place.

13
00:00:28.793 --> 00:00:29.674
Completely free.

14
00:00:30.274 --> 00:00:31.857
Start in the Situation Room.

15
00:00:31.857 --> 00:00:33.044
Describe your crisis.

16
00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:36.153
In under 60 seconds, get the exact regulation violated,

17
00:00:36.153 --> 00:00:39.432
the agency to call, and a complaint letter, ready to file.

18
00:00:39.732 --> 00:00:41.701
Holding a letter written to confuse you?

19
00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.670
The Translator puts it in plain English,

20
00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.378
and tells you what they're legally required to do next.

21
00:00:46.678 --> 00:00:50.225
Meridian maps your situation to every federal protection that covers it,

22
00:00:50.225 --> 00:00:51.801
and builds your escalation plan.

23
00:00:52.101 --> 00:00:55.955
Narrative Mirror turns what you've lived through into testimony that Congress,

24
00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.092
and reporters, can use.

25
00:00:57.392 --> 00:00:59.495
Cartography follows the money and the power,

26
00:00:59.495 --> 00:01:01.598
and shows you exactly where the leverage is.

27
00:01:01.898 --> 00:01:04.161
Two Futures shows the cost of doing nothing.

28
00:01:04.161 --> 00:01:07.813
Authority Strain finds the pressure points that make institutions move.

29
00:01:08.113 --> 00:01:11.291
The Federal Complaint Builder creates a nine letter packet,

30
00:01:11.291 --> 00:01:13.607
pre-cited, and aimed at the right agencies.

31
00:01:13.607 --> 00:01:16.677
Policy Alerts flag every rule change the moment it lands.

32
00:01:16.977 --> 00:01:21.040
Behind it all, live federal intelligence, an Accountability Atlas,

33
00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:26.642
and a Congress Scorecard grading all 535 members on the issues that keep your family alive.

34
00:01:27.442 --> 00:01:30.417
Here's why it works. Vague complaints get archived.

35
00:01:30.417 --> 00:01:32.284
Specific complaints get answers.

36
00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.164
Every complaint creates a federal record.

37
00:01:35.164 --> 00:01:36.892
Every record starts a clock.

38
00:01:36.892 --> 00:01:38.743
And every clock they ignore…

39
00:01:38.743 --> 00:01:39.792
becomes evidence.

40
00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:42.332
No pharmaceutical money.

41
00:01:42.332 --> 00:01:45.748
No hospital grants. No insurer on our board. Ever.

42
00:01:46.548 --> 00:01:50.324
Built by patients and care partners, for patients and care partners.

43
00:01:51.124 --> 00:01:52.260
You are not powerless.

44
00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:53.035
You never were.

45
00:01:53.735 --> 00:01:55.443
Welcome to the Command Center.

46
00:01:55.443 --> 00:01:56.468
Let's get to work.
